<title>UK: Keller order book &quot;significantly&quot; ahead.</title>
<headline>Keller order book &quot;significantly&quot; ahead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm Keller Group Plc said on Thursday that its order book was significantly ahead of last year.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that first quarter trading was broadly in line with expectations.  </p>
<p>&quot;Looking ahead, market conditions are not expected to improve in continental Europe but the outlook is favourable in our other markets,&quot; chairman Michael West told shareholders at the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019L</p>
